msgstr "Perceptualno"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioRelativeColorimetric)
#: libs/ui/forms/wdgapplyprofile.ui:103
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Within and outside gamut; same as Absolute Colorimetric. White point changed "
"to result in neutral grays."
msgstr ""
"U okviru i izvan opsega boja, isto kao apsolutna kolorimetrija. Bela tačka "
"pomjerena ka neutralnim sivima."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioRelativeColorimetric)
#: libs/ui/forms/wdgapplyprofile.ui:106
#, kde-format
msgid "Relative colorimetric"
msgstr "Relativna kolorimetrija"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioSaturation)
#: libs/ui/forms/wdgapplyprofile.ui:113
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Hue and saturation maintained with lightness sacrificed to maintain "
"saturation. White point changed to result in neutral grays. Intended for "
"business graphics (make it colorful charts, graphs, overheads, ...)"
msgstr ""
"Nijansa i zasićenje zadržano, svjetlina žrtvovana zarad održanja zasićena. "
"Bela tačka promijenjena na neutralne sive. Namenjeno za poslovnu grafiku "
"(raznobojne dijagrame, grafikone, projekcije,...)"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, radioAbsoluteColorimetric)
#: libs/ui/forms/wdgapplyprofile.ui:123
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Within the destination device gamut; hue, lightness and saturation are "
"maintained. Outside the gamut; hue and lightness are maintained, saturation "
"is sacrificed. White point for source and destination; unchanged. Intended "
"for spot colors (Pantone, TruMatch, logo colors, ...)"
msgstr ""
"U okviru opsega boja odredišnog uređaja; nijansa, svjetlina i zasićenje se "
"održavaju. Izvan opsega, nijansa i svjetlina se održavaju, zasićenje je "
"žrtvovano. Bela tačka za izvor i odredište je nepromijenjena. Namenjeno "
"tačkastim bojama (Pantone, TruMatch, boje logoa, ...)"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioAbsoluteColorimetric)
#: libs/ui/forms/wdgapplyprofile.ui:126
#, kde-format
msgid "Absolute colorimetric"
msgstr "Apsolutna kolorimetrija"

